# Generated artifacts keep their bytes.
#
# The rest of this tree is CRLF in the working copy and LF in the index,
# which is right for files people edit. docs/架构图/ holds two files
# nobody edits: one written by scripts/build_arch_spec.py and one by a
# renderer outside this repository. Converting those on checkout leaves
# the working copy differing from the index by line ending alone — git
# status calls it modified while git diff finds nothing, and the
# disagreement follows every clone around. Written LF by both producers,
# stored LF, checked out LF, so there is nothing to disagree about.
docs/架构图/*.json -text
docs/架构图/*.html -text
